    "name": "Boracay Midtown Hotel",
    "detail": "Cheapest hotel available. Facilities are new. Not sure if Budget Room Boracay Island Hostel is different from MidTown Hotel but the room we booked here in Agoda is with Boracay Island Hostel and when we arrived, we stayed in MidTown Hotel. The place is pretty new. Wifi access is good. Airconditioning is great and they have shower heater which is also great. I suggest that they should clean the rooms at least once if customers are staying for at least 3 days. Should also proactively offer a change of towels and beddings. We stayed there for 3 days and 3 nights. Must also increase security. Anyone can just get in because there are no guards and the reception is not available 24/7. Overall, its a really good experience and will definitely stay here again. PS. Shout out to the horel mngr who allowed us to do late check out without addiotional fees. Thanks!",
